<body>
    <h1>47. GDPR</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h1 local-id=3D"ad5cf809-c66d-4a1c-aa43-74a3246e4b05" id=3D"id-47.G=
DPR-Overview">
<style>[data-colorid=3Daprdicdhz3]{color:#374151} html[data-color-mode=3Dda=
rk] [data-colorid=3Daprdicdhz3]{color:#aeb8c8}[data-colorid=3Dw7gn7zr5j5]{c=
olor:#374151} html[data-color-mode=3Ddark] [data-colorid=3Dw7gn7zr5j5]{colo=
r:#aeb8c8}[data-colorid=3Dmjy5rpduga]{color:#ff5630} html[data-color-mode=
=3Ddark] [data-colorid=3Dmjy5rpduga]{color:#cf2600}[data-colorid=3Dp7qoctx1=
4b]{color:#2f3941} html[data-color-mode=3Ddark] [data-colorid=3Dp7qoctx14b]=
{color:#bec8d0}[data-colorid=3Dsqt2trehxk]{color:#bf2600} html[data-color-m=
ode=3Ddark] [data-colorid=3Dsqt2trehxk]{color:#ff6640}</style><strong>Overv=
iew</strong></h1>
<p local-id=3D"46aab21e-5812-46c5-b530-0ea673858b12"><strong>GDPR is short =
for&nbsp;</strong><em><strong>General Data Protection Regulation.</strong><=
/em></p>
<p local-id=3D"acea4c06-e7b5-4920-a117-3a50aa6c0c8f"><span data-colorid=3D"=
aprdicdhz3">Global Data Privacy is a regulation&nbsp;that requires business=
es to protect the personal data and privacy of Tripadvisor customers, both =
users and owners.&nbsp;The General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) is reg=
arded as one of the most stringent laws globally concerning privacy and sec=
urity. Although it was formulated and enacted by the European Union (EU), i=
t places responsibilities on organizations worldwide as long as they intera=
ct with or gather information about individuals in the EU. According to thi=
s regulation, companies that fail to meet these strict privacy and security=
 requirements could face substantial fines, potentially reaching tens of mi=
llions of euros.</span></p>
<p local-id=3D"39137f93-79a3-4aff-9964-dc46788b2011">Agents MUST escalate a=
ll Zendesk tickets, reviews, or review votes/comments that reference:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"2202a70d-e7c3-4f56-83b4-25e2c6d18ce7">
<li local-id=3D"f16d1c83-d2f0-40b9-ab82-625ca6429d3f">
<p local-id=3D"93b923a3-3b45-41bb-8dfa-64f597825586">Global Data Privacy</p=
></li>
<li local-id=3D"6f7b41cb-88a5-47c0-8fb5-f0eb2ef008dc">
<p local-id=3D"0ca1fc8f-3f70-4d81-8054-8f6603348ace">GDPR,&nbsp;<span data-=
colorid=3D"w7gn7zr5j5">General Data Protection Regulation</span></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6100e0b8-09f5-4086-9ff0-614d57e454a3">
<p local-id=3D"a3db6543-2c77-4fdd-b598-f75a9d9c735f">CCPA,&nbsp;California =
Consumer Privacy Act/ California Privacy Act</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8ad6959d-604d-4abb-a8d3-439078a2d8de">
<p local-id=3D"d8dccbdf-429f-415f-b290-7d46d578cce2">New Privacy Regulation=
s</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"19a94fa5-e40f-43d6-be4e-3d68c006d43e">
<p local-id=3D"3e1c9eee-e34e-4a6f-82da-a6fd031409ed">Korean privacy laws/Ko=
rean data protection laws</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9c96ef83-6a7e-40c0-af6d-0afc9c3b7c56">
<p local-id=3D"135b3690-2156-4a40-a739-da5bd84864aa">Data Protection Act/Re=
gulation/Directive/GDPR/KVKK - if you're unfamiliar with an acronym, google=
 it!</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"415ae7df-184c-444f-80c3-9a44fbf9d77d">
<p local-id=3D"8ef9a978-987c-4c51-a860-ebab184d8ed8">or text of a similar n=
ature or context!</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"f134ca6e-9365-4582-9359-71b0389542f2"><em><strong><span clas=
s=3D"legacy-color-text-red2">When you detect GDPR-related language, escalat=
e the ticket to Tier 2</span></strong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-defa=
ult"> following the steps outlined below. If a review violates moderation g=
uidelines or you have evidence of it being from a former member of staff, y=
ou must take action on the review AND escalate the ticket to Tier 2. Note t=
hat there is a special escalation process for GDPR-related tickets that mus=
t be followed.&nbsp;</span></em></p>
<p local-id=3D"a5b7e5b4-1825-4c3e-9cd8-03730e983f91"><em><strong><span clas=
s=3D"legacy-color-text-default">If Tier 2 does not consider the case a GDPR=
 case, we will send it back to the agent with instructions.&nbsp;<u>When in=
 doubt, escalate to Tier 2. </u></span></strong></em></p>
<p local-id=3D"5eb4dc5a-b930-498d-a21a-2c4a3edf4e6e"></p>
<p local-id=3D"c2f15361-6cb9-45fc-a907-828386f84dfc"><em><strong><span clas=
s=3D"legacy-color-text-default"><u>Scenarios:</u></span></strong></em></p>
<p local-id=3D"abfa0169-b713-4047-9105-c2e927fa624a"><span class=3D"legacy-=
color-text-default">Owners as well as Users may reach out with privacy conc=
erns, and their requests may sound like the ones below:</span></p>
<p local-id=3D"11890ee1-d700-4999-b907-e9f720eea857">"With whom do you shar=
e my data? STOP sharing now."</p>
<p local-id=3D"d7a5c5de-6e7b-4a4c-97c3-008de900f6b6">"Subject Access Reques=
t or Data Subject Access Request"</p>
<p local-id=3D"fac71a15-deee-4350-9b41-7438507796ab">"I want a copy of my e=
mails/data/phone recordings."</p>
<p local-id=3D"bb191ee8-c292-44dd-9253-8b510b2e51fb">"Who is your Data Prot=
ection Officer? (DPO)"</p>
<p local-id=3D"a5df5132-14ef-478a-b3f5-6381b4713c15">"Are you complying wit=
h the CCPA / GDPR?" (or other acronyms you are not familiar with--kindly lo=
ok it up; if you can't find it, please escalate)</p>
<p local-id=3D"357c427d-f099-49c1-a457-f7a7663008ad">"I want to exercise my=
 access rights/right to be forgotten."</p>
<p local-id=3D"37da2e36-f00e-4fdd-9657-4a53dd2f4e41">"Please take down all =
the reviews of Hotel XYZ based on CCPA / GDPR"</p>
<p local-id=3D"987318e8-7fc9-4945-be97-036d5691eea3">"I have not permitted =
you to publish my photo, and you are violating my privacy as per legal priv=
acy regulations."</p>
<p local-id=3D"7cb3f2c4-0dc1-446d-816b-60d2db8ca673">"Please erase this lis=
ting from TripAdvisor based on KVKK."</p>
<p local-id=3D"b2046b7b-e94d-4359-9a43-03f346a177c9">"Privacy Laws in Europ=
e state you cannot mention my name in this review."</p>
<p local-id=3D"8af8ef3f-65b2-4158-b2bf-d130ef210288">"I want a copy of all =
the reviews of my restaurant based on GDPR."</p>
<p local-id=3D"d202d139-c89e-4ab9-bddc-6ca07d42d85d"></p>
<p local-id=3D"b5aa477c-241c-4927-b228-a99d72aa2745"><strong><span class=3D=
"legacy-color-text-red2">All of these need to be escalated!</span></strong>=
</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"79b951ff-0e46-4635-ae73-e8c3152056f6" id=3D"id-47.GDPR-Howt=
oescalateGDPRcasestoTier2:">How to escalate GDPR cases to Tier 2:</h2>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"64b19624-5361-4b04-8dac-3bbd98559a7b">
<li local-id=3D"3eb956e5-3b06-4668-919f-7c7915bb96fa">
<p local-id=3D"8f6306ae-d9bf-4185-af6f-1deb03debe92">Select the *Escalate/T=
ransfer::To FS Tier 2 macro in the Zendesk ticket</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3829a2df-ed33-4275-a5f4-88124aa66556">
<p local-id=3D"c29180f5-a113-4c33-bd57-7684ccb23a59">Fill all the fields wi=
th as much relevant information as possible, especially the reason why you =
are escalating; <strong>tick the&nbsp;</strong><em><strong><span data-color=
id=3D"p7qoctx14b">GDPR Request (right to be forgotten) </span></strong></em=
><strong>box on the left-hand side</strong>.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"44e9acc9-a653-4cda-a2e2-13acd434032a">
<p local-id=3D"37c6fbd7-7438-4e49-b861-d41ac15a58a3">Submit the ticket as O=
PEN.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b1d8d32b-f6ce-415e-9d5d-0d42ff120aaa">
<p local-id=3D"78263712-2010-442f-91e2-29d78ef441c8">This automatically ass=
igns the ticket to Katrin Mooney and triggers an email notification to the =
entire Tier 2 Team. There's no need to tick the "Escalation to Tier 2" box.=
&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<h2 local-id=3D"50593674f153" id=3D"id-47.GDPR-Itisextremelyimportanttotick=
thisbox,asfailuretodosoresultsinacriticalerror."><span data-colorid=3D"mjy5=
rpduga">It is extremely important to tick this box, as failure to do so res=
ults in a critical error.</span><span data-colorid=3D"sqt2trehxk">&nbsp;</s=
pan></h2><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-left-wrapper=
 confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image i=
mage-left" width=3D"400" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"96e47042921a37355d5d69a016=
403931c725fdcad96d3147089301aa26b9c789" data-image-src=3D"https://tripadvis=
or.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/300105568/GDPR.png?version=3D1&a=
mp;modificationDate=3D1704226418304&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data=
-height=3D"1453" data-width=3D"601" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" dat=
a-linked-resource-id=3D"300106520" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-=
linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"G=
DPR.png" data-base-url=3D"https://tripadvisor.atlassian.net/wiki" data-link=
ed-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D=
"300105568" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"7" data-media-id=3D"9=
e729699-76d7-450b-8749-1bb2402ce55d" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"970=
"></span>
<p local-id=3D"4fd2fcce-1fe1-46fb-a73e-6ba3c7b56b42"></p>
<p local-id=3D"77a62529-4bca-42ee-8ce1-f7b04653d57a"><em>Escalations to QAs=
: If the agent asks for a supervisor's opinion, it is VERY IMPORTANT that t=
his is documented in the notes. We need to know when the agent asked for a =
supervisor's opinion, what they asked, and what instructions they received.=
</em></p>
<h2 local-id=3D"6355d2a9-ca5d-4d4e-be49-1cb11987f1d1" id=3D"id-47.GDPR-Nota=
GDPRconcern:">Not a GDPR concern:</h2>
<p local-id=3D"691baf3b-8788-495d-9439-25c045ca579d">Owner review disputes =
where we ask owners for evidence, and they respond by saying they're uncomf=
ortable sharing a guest's or staff/former staff member's information due to=
 privacy concerns. Agents can respond to these concerns with the "GDPR conc=
erns" macro.&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"577fcdb5-6202-4ffb-9589-3906d61c06d4">Examples of this may i=
nclude:</p>
<p local-id=3D"118b5620-1eec-4b6f-ba3a-ab8de4cde30a">"In line with our priv=
acy policies, we are not in a position to divulge such details."</p>
<p local-id=3D"27479a72-666f-44ff-9817-92ea7f400c5b">"Our legal team inform=
s us that we cannot share any of this guest's information with you due to G=
DPR concerns."</p>
<p local-id=3D"dba23625-5b76-43cf-8f7e-215c1d68672c"></p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"2836.5640000000003" data-layout=3D"full-width" d=
ata-local-id=3D"475b8cfb-23ab-439d-ab66-902db214ef4c" class=3D"confluenceTa=
ble">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 1353.12px;">
<col style=3D"width: 1483.44px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"f01dfe2e-b7ba-44d1-bf69-cd5f457528da">
<th data-local-id=3D"18311b15-a958-4a87-9f68-014a40bfae79" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"4a9cfefc-d2a7-4265-9b60-f368a73faef6"><strong>Escalate to Ti=
er 2</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"ed161f7c-3a8a-4ffa-8959-c1bf1b4cc836" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"fb5daaa2-44d4-4823-a2dc-bd3700268c79"><strong>Tier 1 can han=
dle</strong></p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"0fef9225-7222-4e61-b48b-c849eabfe5db">
<td data-local-id=3D"18708372-d4fd-49bb-b829-ae0fd1a35992" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f85e10a6-23a3-4014-b729-77bb2d93563f">"Under GDPR, you need =
my permission to list my restaurant on your site."</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c00a7866-f7d2-481a-b75f-185c76cfbf30" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c952ce59-3f02-46ae-a22a-8645bd3ba43a">"I never agreed to hav=
ing my restaurant listed on your site. Please remove it." (Handle with "TA =
doesn't remove listings" macro)&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"66f741f5-145e-4ffe-941c-96e3d3cadc74">
<td data-local-id=3D"ae859139-7a54-40ad-926e-34864ead40b5" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"dd9ae1db-7f91-4b18-9a61-6f1eab2c79af">"The reviewer mentions=
 my full name in the review. I feel this violates my rights to privacy."</p=
></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7a4d7f37-439f-4e9b-97de-abd8a0824778" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"efe58d46-04cd-4f2a-94a1-28380ad9295e">"The reviewer mentions=
 my name in the review. Please remove it."</p>
<p local-id=3D"2cd14290-a4d4-4989-9c41-8fe4f8bef264">(Handle according to C=
MI guidelines.&nbsp;Remember: First names are always okay to publish.&nbsp;=
If only the first name is present and RMG, you can send the =E2=80=9CStaff =
Names=E2=80=9D macro to owners.</p>
<p local-id=3D"489107ec-a966-4e2a-bd5b-05b1a659cea5">When reported to us (v=
ia the URD or Zendesk), reviews with staff full names who are not manager l=
evel or above should be removed. If the review otherwise meets guidelines, =
you can send the "Review Removed (CM Removal - User can resubmit" macro.</p=
></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
